<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>A place for everything, for everything a place.</l><l>My bat and bike, my skates and trike</l><l>Put each thing in its place!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>A place for everything, for everything a place.</l><l>My plate I think goes in the sink!</l><l>Put each thing in its place!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>A place for everything, for everything a place.</l><l>Our hats and coats, our boots and totes</l><l>Put each thing in its place!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
